OL,3,APetrol and diesel price rises push UK
OL,4,Ainflation rate up to 3.1%
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rate of UK inflation rose to 3.1%
OL,7,Fin the year to August, according to
OL,8,Ffigures from the Office for National
OL,9,FStatistics
OL,11,FPetrol and diesel price rises
OL,12,Fcontribute to the increase, as does the
OL,13,Fincreasing cost of airfares
OL,15,FChancellor John Healey says the Middle
OL,16,FEast war is impacting inflation
OL,17,Fworldwide but the UK economy is
OL,18,F"proving resilient"
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
