OL,3,APetrol and diesel price rises push UK
OL,4,Ainflation rate up to 3.1%
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat is inflation? It measures the
OL,7,Fincrease in the price of something over
OL,8,Ftime - the Bank of England has a target
OL,9,Fof keeping the rate at 2%
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
