OL,3,ALetby doctor says inquiry 'grim
OL,4,Areading' and he wishes 'we had been
OL,5,Abrave enough to follow suspicions'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said that he accepted that
OL,8,Fconsultants must bear "collective"
OL,9,Fresponsibility for some of the failings
OL,10,Fidentified in the report.
OL,12,F"I wish we consultants had been brave
OL,13,Fenough to follow our suspicions and
OL,14,Fescalate things to the police earlier,"
OL,15,Fhe told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
