OL,3,AUS limits visas for South African
OL,4,Aofficials over alleged anti-white
OL,5,Adiscrimination
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US has announced visa restrictions
OL,8,Ftargeting people it accuses of
OL,9,Fdiscriminating against South Africa's
OL,10,Fwhite minority, in the latest
OL,11,Fescalation of tensions between the two
OL,12,Fcountries.
OL,14,FThe Trump administration has criticised
OL,15,FSouth Africa over several issues,
OL,16,Fincluding policies aimed at addressing
OL,17,Fracial inequality that it says
OL,18,Fdiscriminate against Afrikaners,
OL,19,Fdescendants mainly of Dutch and French
OL,20,Fsettlers.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
