OL,3,AUS limits visas for South African
OL,4,Aofficials over alleged anti-white
OL,5,Adiscrimination
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Africa has repeatedly denied the
OL,8,Fclaim.
OL,10,F"The South African government has not
OL,11,Fadequately addressed the previously
OL,12,Flaid b@Kout concerns," Secretary of
OL,13,FState Marco Rubio said in a statement
OL,14,Fannouncing the restrictions on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
